"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Additional properties which will be added as the query parameters to the authentication redirect URI.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_OIDC__TENANT__AUTHENTICATION_EXTRA_PARAMS+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

