"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"SameSite attribute for the session, state and post logout cookies.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_OIDC__TENANT__AUTHENTICATION_COOKIE_SAME_SITE+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr ""

