"[[quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.-tenant-.token-state-manager.strategy]]`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.-tenant-.token-state-manager.strategy[quarkus.oidc.\"tenant\".token-state-manager.strategy]`\n"
